<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes have erupted in Yaounde, Douala and Maroua as Cameroonian security forces confront Ambazonian separatists, extending fighting beyond the Northwest and Southwest. Separatist attacks continue in the Anglophone regions, ten years after the crisis began. UNESCO has joined national efforts to prevent femicide in Cameroon. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;NZ Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE9YNlpBX2lqV05EcFdvSWZkdVZLalhfdzhQWGZ0WF9MTjJoc0hVWW02eXFGUGQtTE5ob2lDN3V4SXR0WGp6Mm5CWXRWMnRaOUtM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNQTNNdzM1YUZrbVBqY3hvNHRPdF9fMno4VE1GRlE1eGIwaEtldGdJS25zUnpPWVZ6dC1mNVVlZnYwTmNDOEt4WWd6bHVTeDVVRHVGVWg4QkVGNENCZkhkaWNVWTFGNURSZUxmRks3aVN0SXp0T0dGT2JtOVA5Rkh6X0ozMDRmY3FrdmJHakY5bWx6Rzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Africa Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxObTM4QUgwMkFSU1hZWlJvMGNUR1VUeUUxdmI2NlRKQ2l4ZGc3dHR5alRTdDdJUFY5ZDh4MG1RTEc3b3lwd2lhUEllNTlkNjh1bWlpNUxoMG5Fd1JoeGwwRnZwZGF1Q19WV3pZd29PQ0xXVmlnck1TWXVVZ2pkYWVyTThSSmZqbnBRN2hvYVpBZmpOcHZnZkF1amoyZzBhU0FfSzNQYnUyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Genocide Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Camer.be&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOM1JLSmlLZEZtblczbzcxaHFVZjR6ZVl6dzdIVmJ0QnlqbV8xa3dVLS1qZmI0N0stSkwxcXhNa0o1M29jYl9IWlloUjBLQVMwc2t4a1gtY1RRWUZJc3ZqLUdkaWVCajEwR3ZZS2pQdG5QYXVvOG11Y0w3VmM1VmhPUXRpc1NuOGp1a3JPdjJUSVlEeElJSDI